@startuml
title Admin manages taxonomy
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Admin" as U
participant "Admin Console" as C
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Supabase" as S
participant "Activity Log" as L

U -> C: Create, update or delete a taxonomy item
C -> A: POST/PUT/DELETE /api/admin/{categories|tags|publishers}
A -> A: validateCategory / validateTag / validatePublisher
A -> S: assertSlugAvailable(slug)
S --> A: slug free
A -> S: insert / update / delete row
S --> A: saved row
A -> L: record taxonomy.<action>
A --> C: 200/201 row
C --> U: Refresh taxonomy list
note over A: Deleting a publisher that still owns templates returns 409.
@enduml
